  BookText: "<size=120%><align=\"center\">\r\rThe Five Tenets\n\n<size=100%><align=\"left\">Tenet
    1: Never dishonor the Night Mother. To do so is to invoke the Wrath of Sithis.\n\n\rTenet
    2: Never betray the Dark Brotherhood or its secrets. To do so is to invoke the
    Wrath of Sithis.\n\n\rTenet 3: Never disobey or refuse to carry out an order from
    a Dark Brotherhood superior. To do so is to invoke the Wrath of Sithis.\n\n\rTenet
    4: Never steal the possessions of a Dark Brother or Dark Sister. To do so is to
    invoke the Wrath of Sithis.\n\n\rTenet 5: Never kill a Dark Brother or Dark Sister.
    To do so is to invoke the Wrath of Sithis."
  CantBeTaken: 0
